  },
  {
   "text": "It's so nice to have him MC as well.",
   "start": 14.64,
   "end": 17.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Give it a one while come to Leah, Journal Manager, the IU.",
   "start": 17.16,
   "end": 20.04
  },
  {
   "text": "Yeah, you know, we're so happy to open the show for you.",
   "start": 23.1,
   "end": 26.34
  },
  {
   "text": "And hi to everyone watching along all night.",
   "start": 26.4,
   "end": 28.56
  },
  {
   "text": "AIE code is kind of our vertical, very focused, smaller format, you know, format on coding agents.",
   "start": 28.68,
   "end": 38.04
  },
  {
   "text": "And I think it's been such a huge year in coll agents.",
   "start": 38.1,
   "end": 40.44
  },
  {
   "text": "There's also been a lot of different evolutions in terms of like how we think about what the mission of coding is.",
   "start": 40.5,
   "end": 47.1
  },
  {
   "text": "We used to have, you know, in specific track titles, like coding agents and software factories and all these things, but now I'm talking about, like, just the one thinking and raising your ambition and all these, like, very fancy higher level attractions of work.",
   "start": 47.16,
   "end": 61.02
  },
  {
   "text": "So, I'm excited to see, for you to see, and I decided to, me personally, to attend, all these talks that are coming along.",
   "start": 61.08,
   "end": 67.98
  },
  {
